     '派发信封可携带的已批准弹窗规则条数上限（默认 50；建单时按项目取已批准规则随信封下发，超限取最近创建的 N 条，调整即时生效）')
ON CONFLICT (config_key) DO NOTHING;

-- ################ V470__doc_group_max_chapters_key.sql ################
-- Migration: chapter-span cap for the document-extraction grouping plane
-- .
--
-- Why this file exists:
--   Chapter-aligned grouping seals a group where the chapter changes, but a
--   document with many SHORT chapters could still weld dozens of them into
--   one node while the token/chunk ceilings stay below reach — one prompt
--   then spans a whole document section and its summary node labels stop
--   meaning anything. This key caps how many DISTINCT chapters one sealed
--   group may carry: the group closes the moment adding a chunk from a NEW
--   chapter would push the count past the cap, and a single oversized
--   chapter is still bounded by the token/chunk ceilings (the cap never
--   splits inside one chapter). Write side validates the same window; the
--   reader fails closed to the factory value.
INSERT INTO tp_sys_config (config_key, config_value, group_name, value_type, encrypt_flag, description) VALUES
    ('ai.doc.group-max-chapters', '20', '系统', 'string', 0, '单个提取节点跨越的最大章节数（默认 20，允许 1~1000；短章节过多时节点在集满该章数处封口，单个超长章节仍按内容量与块数上限拆分。保存即生效，无需重启）')
ON CONFLICT (config_key) DO NOTHING;

-- ################ V471__appauto_mobilewright_record_native.sql ################
-- Flip the native recording capability bit for the Mobilewright engine.
-- The adapter self-reports executed action frames through its record_events
-- hook (recording chain level 1), so a recording session now resolves to
-- "native" instead of the scrcpy fallback, which samples adb getevent kernel
-- events and is physically blind to framework-level input injections.
UPDATE tp_appauto_engine
   SET capabilities = jsonb_set(capabilities, '{record-native}', 'true'::jsonb, false)
 WHERE code = 'MOBILEWRIGHT'
   AND capabilities ->> 'record-native' IS DISTINCT FROM 'true';

-- ################ V472__help_doc_element_library_chapter.sql ################
-- V472: help chapter for the element library page (/appauto/elements) in the
-- app-automation domain X. The leaf carries a chapter anchor
-- chapter that teaches what the page does: locator profiles kept once and
-- referenced by name from app steps. Idempotent: (domain_code, sort_no)
-- unique key, ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING.
-- Usage: docker exec -i -e PGPASSWORD="$DB_PASSWORD" testpike-postgres psql -U "$DB_USERNAME" -d testpike -f - < db/migration/V472__help_doc_element_library_chapter.sql

INSERT INTO tp_help_doc (domain_code, title, body_md, sort_no, version) VALUES
('X', '元素库：定位方式存成档案，步骤只引用不重复配', $mdq$## 元素库

元素库把 APP 界面上要操作的控件（按钮、输入框、区域）的定位方式存成档案。步骤里只按元素名称引用，不各写一份定位参数：控件换了位置或换了 id，改档案一处，所有引用它的步骤下次执行即生效。

| 列 | 一句话说明 |
| --- | --- |
| 元素名称 | 项目内唯一，步骤按这个名字引用 |
| 定位方式 | IMAGE（图像匹配）/ COORD（坐标）/ REGION（区域）/ OCR（文字识别） |
| 定位参数 | 一组 JSON 参数，例如资源 id、匹配文本、坐标或图片归档号 |
| 置信阈值 | 图像/OCR 匹配的最低分数（0 到 1），低于阈值按定位失败处理 |
| 分辨率变体 | 同一元素在不同分辨率屏幕上的备选取图，执行时按设备分辨率优先匹配 |

## 怎么用
1. 顶栏选中项目，本页只显示该项目的元素档案；新建/编辑/删除需要该项目的管理权限。
2. 点「新建元素」，先选定位方式，再按 JSON 填写定位参数；格式或取值不合规时保存会被拒绝并提示具体原因。
3. 列表按名称即时搜索、按定位方式筛选，数据多时翻页查看；页态记录在地址里，刷新或分享链接后筛选和页码保持不变。
4. 定位的实际查找与容错由执行侧统一处理，本页只维护档案内容本身。

**常用入口**：左侧菜单「APP 自动化 → 元素库」。$mdq$, 91, '2.99')
ON CONFLICT (domain_code, sort_no) DO NOTHING;

-- ################ V473__extract_fidelity_ledger_generalize.sql ################
-- EE batch (piece 1, A2 single-source): generalize the extraction
-- fidelity ledger so the spec-extract and qa-gen planes can book the same
-- account instead of rejecting over-sized inputs outright.
-- * document_id -> ref_id and extract_token -> run_id: the identity pair now
--   scopes a fidelity face for any extraction task, not only a document
--   generation. tp_document.extract_token and tp_ai_call_log.extract_token
--   are columns of OTHER tables that merely share the word - they stay.
-- * task_type tags which plane booked the row; the factory default keeps
--   every existing document row attributed without a data backfill.
-- * the FK to tp_document stays: every referenced row today is a document,
--   so the cascade account is unchanged.
ALTER TABLE tp_doc_extract_fidelity RENAME COLUMN document_id TO ref_id;
ALTER TABLE tp_doc_extract_fidelity RENAME COLUMN extract_token TO run_id;
ALTER TABLE tp_doc_extract_fidelity ADD COLUMN task_type VARCHAR(32) NOT NULL DEFAULT 'doc-extract';

COMMENT ON COLUMN tp_doc_extract_fidelity.ref_id IS 'Row the fidelity face belongs to (a document today; spec/qa targets join in later pieces) - cascades with tp_document while rows reference documents';
COMMENT ON COLUMN tp_doc_extract_fidelity.run_id IS 'Generation token minted by core; (ref_id, run_id) scopes the fidelity face to one extraction run';
COMMENT ON COLUMN tp_doc_extract_fidelity.task_type IS 'Plane that booked the run: doc-extract (factory default, document requirement extraction), spec-extract, qa-gen';

-- ################ V474__judge_qa_gen_plane_timeout_ceiling_key.sql ################
-- Migration: question-generation plane LLM per-call timeout ceiling .
--
-- Why this file exists:
--   Document 9016's grouped qa-gen run rode the global 300s provider window;
--   one wedged upstream attempt burned 300s x 3 retries = 900s on a single
--   group, while the measured healthy single-group call needs only 25~60s.
--   The judge plane now composes its OWN ceiling under the caller clamp (same
--   shape as the extraction plane, one shared seam in LlmTimeoutResolver),
--   read hot per call through LlmTimeoutResolver.resolveJudgeQaGen.
--   Default derivation: 120s = 2x the observed healthy upper bound (60s), so
--   healthy runs stay byte-identical while a wedged provider costs at most
--   120s x 3 retries = 360s per group instead of 900s.
--   Value semantics: blank = follow the global llm.timeout-seconds face (zero
--   behaviour change); otherwise a whole-second value inside the same 10~300
--   window the global key pins. The write side rejects out-of-window and
--   garbage values with a plain 400 naming the bounds; the reader falls back
--   to the global face with a warn, never silently off.
INSERT INTO tp_sys_config (config_key, config_value, group_name, value_type, encrypt_flag, description) VALUES
    ('ai.judge.qa-gen.llm-timeout-seconds', '120', '系统', 'string', 0, '出题生成链单次调用的超时上限（秒）。留空=沿用全局 llm.timeout-seconds；填写则只收紧出题生成链（分组造题）的单次调用。允许 10~300；超界或不合规会被拒绝并提示原因。保存即生效，无需重启')
ON CONFLICT (config_key) DO NOTHING;

-- ################ V475__judge_qa_gen_plane_timeout_default_600.sql ################
-- Raise the question-generation plane call ceiling default from 120s to 600s
-- (user order 2026-11-09): long grouped question generation needs a wider per-call
-- window. The reader bounds move to 10~900 in the same release; fresh installs get
-- 600 straight from schema-init, this migration updates existing databases and only
-- rewrites the legacy 120 so manual overrides stay untouched.
UPDATE tp_sys_config
   SET config_value = '600',
