 '零售定制收银终端；应用载体与手机同走 APK 通道，机群用设备标签圈组绑定', 1),
('PDA', '手持 PDA', '["REAL"]'::jsonb, '["apk"]'::jsonb,
 '仓储/门店盘点手持终端；应用载体与手机同走 APK 通道，机群用设备标签圈组绑定', 1)
ON CONFLICT (code) DO NOTHING;

-- ################ V486__appauto_batch_perf_snapshot.sql ################
-- =====================================================================
-- Migration: batch mobile performance snapshot columns
-- tp_batch_report gains mobile_perf_json + prev_batch_id so the
-- finalization-time report carries the batch-level rollup of the mobile
-- sampling numbers already landed on each task's result_ext
-- (mobilePerfSummary), together with the previous-cycle comparison:
-- the nearest earlier finalized batch of the same project and environment.
-- Honest absence: batches without any mobile reading keep mobile_perf_json
-- NULL (never zero-filled); the first batch of a cycle keeps
-- prev_batch_id NULL and its rollup rows carry no prevMedian/delta.
-- Flyway is not enabled in dev; apply manually with
-- tools/ops/apply_slot_migration.sh, then regenerate db/schema-init.sql
-- with tools/ops/gen_schema_init.sh.
-- =====================================================================
ALTER TABLE tp_batch_report ADD COLUMN IF NOT EXISTS mobile_perf_json JSONB;
ALTER TABLE tp_batch_report ADD COLUMN IF NOT EXISTS prev_batch_id BIGINT;

COMMENT ON COLUMN tp_batch_report.mobile_perf_json IS 'Batch mobile sampling rollup: {"metrics":{"<name>":{"median","taskCount"[,"prevMedian","delta"]},"prevBatchId"}; computed once at finalization from reported task numbers, NULL when no task reported mobile metrics';
COMMENT ON COLUMN tp_batch_report.prev_batch_id IS 'Previous-cycle batch (nearest earlier finalized batch of the same project and environment, excluding self; NULL for the first batch); provenance anchor for prevMedian/delta inside the mobile rollup';

-- ################ V487__doc_extract_deadline_floor_7200.sql ################
-- Raise the document-extraction task deadline default from 900s to 7200s
-- (user order 2026-11-10): long-document extraction legitimately runs for
-- hours, and the 15-minute default cut healthy jobs mid-flight. The consume
-- lease keeps its 15min cadence because the renewal watchdog keeps the lock
-- alive while a run is in flight, and the stall sweeper reclaims on idle
-- (no-progress) rows, not on total elapsed time — neither needs a change.
-- Only the untouched default (still 900) is rewritten; manual overrides stay.
UPDATE tp_sys_config
   SET config_value = '7200',
       description = '文档提取任务级时长预算秒数（默认 7200=2 小时；提取全程超出该预算即中止并恢复为可重新提取状态，再次发起提取即可；单次模型调用超时按剩余时间自动缩短；非法值按默认 7200 回退；热更即生效）'
 WHERE config_key = 'ai.doc.extract-deadline-seconds'
   AND config_value = '900';

-- ################ V488__doc_summary_cache_items_plane.sql ################
-- remediation ②: a second cache plane on tp_doc_summary_cache. The
-- grouped raw-extraction face reuses per-group REQUIREMENT
-- ITEMS exactly the way segment B reused per-group summaries: rows with
-- plane='items' (group_seq >= 1, item-list JSON) land as soon as one group
-- finishes, so a mid-run failure of the same generation skips the finished
-- groups instead of re-burning their model calls (the 17-group document
-- pattern). Existing rows keep plane='summary' (column default) and the
-- summary face stays byte-identical; the unique key gains the plane
-- dimension so one (document_id, gen_token, group_seq) holds one row per
-- plane side by side. The K8 switch description now states both uses.
ALTER TABLE tp_doc_summary_cache ADD COLUMN IF NOT EXISTS plane VARCHAR(32) NOT NULL DEFAULT 'summary';
ALTER TABLE tp_doc_summary_cache DROP CONSTRAINT IF EXISTS uq_doc_summary_cache;
ALTER TABLE tp_doc_summary_cache ADD CONSTRAINT uq_doc_summary_cache UNIQUE (document_id, gen_token, group_seq, plane);

UPDATE tp_sys_config SET description = '文档提取缓存开关（默认开启；同一提取轮次内重跑时，已算好的分组摘要与已提取的分组成果会被直接复用，不再重复调用模型。值缺失或不合规时按开启处理并在日志点名本键。改为 false 保存即生效，无需重启）'
WHERE config_key = 'ai.doc.summary-cache.enabled';

-- ################ V489__script_segment_keys.sql ################
-- V489__script_segment_keys.sql — seed the three ai.script.* segment keys .
-- Purpose: step-group slicing of stage-2 script generation needs hot-updatable
-- knobs (width / per-slice model-request timeout / per-slice retry). Values are
-- read fresh per generation task (K8 semantics: a change takes effect on the
-- next run). Range enforcement lives in the service layer (AiScriptKeyRanges);
-- the DB carries no CHECK, same as the rest of this key family.
-- slice-timeout-seconds keeps the >=800s per-hop floor for model requests and
-- is registered in the timeout-floor detector alongside it.
-- Idempotent: ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING (replay-safe).
-- Usage: docker exec -i testpike-postgres psql -U "$DB_USERNAME" -d testpike < db/migration/V489__script_segment_keys.sql

INSERT INTO tp_sys_config (config_key, config_value, group_name, value_type, encrypt_flag, description) VALUES
('ai.script.slice-steps',          '10',  '系统', 'int', 0, '步骤组拆片宽度：每次模型请求生成的步骤数（默认10，区间0~100；0=不拆片，整份用例一次生成；参数改动下次生成即生效）'),
('ai.script.slice-timeout-seconds','900', '系统', 'int', 0, '单个步骤组模型请求超时秒（默认900，区间800~3600；超时按该组失败处理）'),
('ai.script.slice-retry',          '1',   '系统', 'int', 0, '单个步骤组失败后的重试次数（默认1，区间0~3；0=不重试）')
ON CONFLICT (config_key) DO NOTHING;

-- ################ V490__resource_pool_segment_cap_key.sql ################
-- Migration: hot cap key for the named project resource-pool entries that
-- ride one stage-2 script prompt .
--
-- Why this file exists:
--   The cap value itself (30) is unchanged — only its form moves from a
--   static constant to a hot key, per the "thresholds configurable, hot
--   updatable, no hardcoding" standard. The fail-closed reader
--   (AiGenServiceImpl.resourceSegmentCap) falls back to 30 for any missing,
--   non-numeric or out-of-window value, and the core write side
--   (ConfigServiceImpl) refuses saves outside 10~100, so neither a silent
--   prompt shrink nor a silent prompt growth can happen through this dial.
INSERT INTO tp_sys_config (config_key, config_value, group_name, value_type, encrypt_flag, description) VALUES
    ('ai.gen.resource-pool.segment-cap', '30', '系统', 'string', 0, '脚本生成提示中列出的项目资源（数据工厂/接口集）条目数上限（默认 30，允许 10~100；超出范围的保存会被拒绝，读取到非法值时按默认 30 生效。清单按与当前用例的相关度排序，环境类地址不受本上限限制。保存即生效，无需重启）')
ON CONFLICT (config_key) DO NOTHING;

-- ################ V491__ai_stream_quiet_tail_guard.sql ################
-- Migration: honest quiet guards for the live process-event stream (tail face).
--
-- Why this file exists:
--   The tail pump used to give up the moment the event ledger stayed quiet
--   past ai.stream.idle-timeout-seconds and told the viewer the stream had
--   broken. Long model calls legitimately idle for minutes, so that frame
--   was a false disconnect. The pump now treats quiet as a milestone: it
--   lands a step-level "still running" frame and keeps tailing, bounded by
--   a per-window cap so an abandoned drawer cannot park threads forever.
-- Behaviour notes:
--   * readers fall back to the same default when the row is missing or
--     malformed — these seeds only make the knobs visible and editable on
--     the configuration page (no second default-value source);
--   * the window cap is per connection, not per job: reconnecting starts a
--     fresh window from the last cursor the viewer already saw.
INSERT INTO tp_sys_config (config_key, config_value, group_name, value_type, encrypt_flag, description) VALUES
    ('ai.stream.tail-max-seconds', '3600', '系统', 'int', 0, '实时过程详情单次打开后持续跟随的总时长上限秒数（默认 3600，允许 10~86400）。达到上限后本窗提示结束并关闭，重新打开可从上次读到的位置继续跟随。保存即生效，无需重启')
ON CONFLICT (config_key) DO NOTHING;

UPDATE tp_sys_config SET description =
    '实时过程详情连续无新事件时的里程碑提示间隔秒数（默认 300，允许 5~3600）。任务未结束而通道持续静默达到该间隔时，只提示一条「任务仍在进行」并继续跟随，不会因此断开。保存即生效，无需重启'
    WHERE config_key = 'ai.stream.idle-timeout-seconds';

-- ################ V492__doc_recall_directive_enabled.sql ################
-- Migration: hot switch for the exhaustive-recall clause block on the
-- requirement-extraction prompt face .
--
-- Why this file exists:
--   Enumeration tasks without a recall instruction settle at the provider's
--   summarising habit (about 5-9 items regardless of source density) and the
--   group-level caches pin that number across reruns. The clause block now
--   rides the extraction system prompt; this key lets an operator turn the
--   recall section off without a redeploy.
-- Behaviour notes:
--   * the reader is fail-soft: a missing, blank or illegal value stays ON
--     (AI features ship enabled), only false/0 turn it off — this seed only
--     makes the knob visible and editable on the configuration page (it is
--     not a second default-value source);
--   * flipping the switch changes the prompt text, and the prompt-face tag
--     mixed into the group cache key re-hashes with it: cached groups are
--     recomputed instead of reusing items pinned under the old wording.
INSERT INTO tp_sys_config (config_key, config_value, group_name, value_type, encrypt_flag, description) VALUES
    ('ai.doc.recall-directive.enabled', 'true', '系统', 'bool', 0, '需求点提取的穷尽召回指令开关（默认开启；开启后提取提示要求逐块挖掘每一条可测试行为、不把独立行为合并成要点、条数不设上限、无需求的块显式声明空块。值缺失或不合规时按开启处理并在日志点名本键。改为 false 后提示恢复旧口径；两种口径之间切换时已缓存的分组会随提示文本变化自动重算，不会沿用旧提示算出的结果。保存即生效，无需重启）')
ON CONFLICT (config_key) DO NOTHING;

-- ################ V493__doc_bucket_output_max_recall_recalibration.sql ################
-- Migration: recalibrate the per-call extraction output budget key.
--
-- Why this file exists:
-- EF batch added the exhaustive-recall clauses to the extraction
--   prompt face on purpose (item count follows the source, no ceiling).
--   The routed thinking model also bills reasoning tokens inside the
--   completion total, so a published max_tokens no longer holds the billed
--   figure below it. The audit line therefore stayed on the old pre-recall
--   prediction (24000) while real calls measured far above it: over the
--   post-booking-seam window the live chain booked 225 plane rows with
--   completion p90=34157 / p95=39940 / p99=47843 and an observed maximum
--   of 69136. The gate's D6 face read red on every batch-close run — a
--   stale ceiling, not a runaway call.
-- Behaviour notes:
--   * 72000 = observed maximum with headroom, inside the 1000~200000
--     write-side window; it stays below the provider output wall the same
--     way the old value did (the same call face kept billing 69136 tokens
--     without truncation);
--   * grouping granularity is untouched: the output-derived input ceiling
--     (72000 / amplification 2.94 ~ 24489) stays above the 8000-token node
--     cap, so sealed groups keep their chapter-aligned size;
--   * value and description are rewritten together so the configuration
--     page never shows a number the reader does not use; replay-safe by
--     IS DISTINCT FROM on the new value (no churn on re-runs).
UPDATE tp_sys_config
   SET config_value = '72000',
       description = '单次提取调用产出 token 的预估上限（默认 72000，允许 1000~200000；穷尽召回口径下产出条数跟随原文且模型推理量计入产出，上限按实测分布重定。超上限的调用会被拒绝并提示超出单次产出预算；预估产出接近上限时会自动按更小的分组多次调用，避免结果被供应商输出上限截断。保存即生效，无需重启）'
 WHERE config_key = 'ai.doc.bucket-output-max-tokens'
   AND (config_value IS DISTINCT FROM '72000'
        OR description IS DISTINCT FROM '单次提取调用产出 token 的预估上限（默认 72000，允许 1000~200000；穷尽召回口径下产出条数跟随原文且模型推理量计入产出，上限按实测分布重定。超上限的调用会被拒绝并提示超出单次产出预算；预估产出接近上限时会自动按更小的分组多次调用，避免结果被供应商输出上限截断。保存即生效，无需重启）');

-- ################ V494__doc_recall_density_floor_key.sql ################
-- Migration: hot budget key for the recall-density output floor on the
-- requirement-extraction reconcile plane .
--
-- Why this file exists:
--   Coverage books settle per cited block, so a dense source that every
--   citation settles on can still come back with a handful of items while
--   its real information density is far higher (live 8491/8639: 121k tokens
--   of source, a few dozen items, both ledger faces reading "done"). The
--   floor turns the run's own item count against the tokens actually shown
--   into a loop entry: fewer items than sourceTokens x floor / 1000 earns
--   targeted re-mining rounds under a dimension-focused ask.
-- Behaviour notes:
--   * the reader is fail-soft: a missing, blank, non-numeric or
--     out-of-window value answers the factory 6.4; only a legal number in
--     0~50 rides through, and 0 switches the check off entirely — this seed
--     only makes the knob visible and editable on the configuration page
--     (it is not a second default-value source);
--   * the write side validates the same 0~50 window so an illegal value
--     never reaches the hot read;
--   * a floor hit lands one line in the extraction log and one stage row on
--     the preview ledger, naming the received count, the floor and the
--     source tokens — the operator can see why the extra rounds burned.
INSERT INTO tp_sys_config (config_key, config_value, group_name, value_type, encrypt_flag, description) VALUES
    ('ai.doc.recall-density-floor-per-ktoken', '6.4', '系统', 'string', 0, '每千 token 原文应产出的需求点条数下限（默认 6.4，允许 0~50，填 0 表示关闭该校验）。提取完成后条数低于「原文 token 数 × 该值 ÷ 1000」时，自动追加定向补充挖掘轮次，把没挖够的原文再挖一遍；补充轮仍无新增产出时提前结束，不会烧满轮次上限。值超出 0~50 区间或不是数字时保存会被拒绝，配置缺失或非法时按默认值 6.4 执行。保存即生效，无需重启）')
ON CONFLICT (config_key) DO NOTHING;

-- ################ V495__help_doc_evalset_write_doors.sql ################
-- Migration: the evaluation-set page's write doors are now in place (manual
-- add / adopted-case promotion / training-sample promotion). The Y|2 chapter
-- grows its usage section to describe the real on-page entries and drops the
-- old "entries will be added later" wording for the three channels that exist
-- now. Batch-result promotion and question-gen entry stay unmentioned as
-- on-page buttons until those doors ship (honest guidance red line).
-- Discipline: body carries no feature-point codes, task numbers, table names
-- or config keys (help-doc scanner gate). Idempotent via ON CONFLICT DO UPDATE
-- at the same (domain_code, sort_no); version ladder 3.00 -> 3.01.
-- Usage: docker exec -i testpike-postgres psql -U testpike -d testpike_slot6 -f - < db/migration/V495__help_doc_evalset_write_doors.sql
INSERT INTO tp_help_doc (domain_code, title, body_md, sort_no, version) VALUES
('Y', '评测集与造题：从零建一轮 AI 评测', $mdq$,
## 这一页能做什么
评测集是给 AI 裁判用的「考卷」：一套带标准答案的样本，按名称和版本管理。这一页让你看清每套考卷里有什么题（样本清单）、考过哪些版本（版本谱系），并提供三种建卷入口：手工添加样本、已采纳用例晋升、训练样本晋升。跑一轮 AI 评测的完整动线是：先有评测集 → 发起评测 → 在评测报告页看结果。

## 怎么用（按操作顺序）
1. **建考卷**：筛选栏右侧点「手工添加」逐行录入问题与期望输出，发布时当前版本已有样本会一并保留、整体定格为新版本；点「采纳晋升」把当前项目里已采纳的用例挑进来成新版本；点「训练样本晋升」从训练样本中勾选条目晋升。三个入口都需要「评测集管理」权限，未授权时按钮不会出现。
2. **选一套考卷**：页面上方选择评测集名称（下拉候选来自已有评测运行中出现过的名称，也可以直接输入），再填版本号，点「查询样本」。
3. **看题目**：下方表格逐条列出该版本的全部样本——问题输入、期望输出、来源、创建时间等；条数多时用表格上方的即时搜索按关键词过滤，翻页用底部分页控件。
4. **认准版本**：版本号越大越新。发布新版本不会覆盖旧版本，历史评测引用的旧版本样本永远原样可查。
5. **看来源**：每条样本标着它是怎么进来的——手工添加、批次执行记录晋升、训练样本晋升或 AI 造题；批次晋升与造题向导的发起入口在本页后续补齐，补齐前可先在对应业务页操作。

## 操作背后系统做了什么
- 晋升与发布都在服务端完成资格判定与版本定格：同一次操作产出一个全新版本号并留下快照摘要，已有版本不被改写；样本不合规矩（来源不明、超长等）会被直接拒绝并说明原因，不会静默入库。
- 敏感标记为「是」的样本会在后续评测出报告时提示注意脱敏，避免把敏感内容带进对外产物。
- 采纳用例晋升走的是服务端入选判定，不满足条件的用例不会被悄悄塞进新版本。

## 常见问题
- 下拉里没有我的评测集名？——下拉候选来自历史评测运行；从未跑过评测的新集可以在发布对话框里直接输入新名称，第一个版本由发布动作建出来。
- 查询提示集或版本不存在？——版本号必须是该集已发布的版本；填错会被明确拒绝，不会返回一个空列表让你误以为集是空的。
- 样本清单为空但版本存在？——该版本发布时就没有样本；用「查询样本」换一个更大的版本号看看最新版本。
- 发布按钮点不动？——手工添加要先填至少一行完整样本（问题和期望输出都不能空）；两种晋升要先勾选至少一条。
$mdq$, 2, '3.01')
ON CONFLICT (domain_code, sort_no) DO UPDATE SET
  title = EXCLUDED.title,
  body_md = EXCLUDED.body_md,
  version = EXCLUDED.version,
  updated_at = now();

