-- Help chapter amendment (distributed-fleet batch, T294d watermark curve band):
-- the executor-pool chapter now documents the per-executor-type watermark
-- history curves (pending depth / replica count / busy machines over time),
-- the periodic sampler that captures the points, the bounded retention window,
-- and how to read empty curves and gaps honestly. User-facing wording only.
-- Idempotent full-body replacement anchored on (domain_code, title), same
